{"assets":[],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"915","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"A. Garden"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"1 second"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Luba thinks about watering her garden. The garden can be represented as a segment of length "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"k"},{"kind":"text","text":". Luba has got "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":" buckets, the "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"i"},{"kind":"text","text":"-th bucket allows her to water some continuous subsegment of garden of length "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"exactly"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"ai"},{"kind":"text","text":" each hour. "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Luba can't water any parts of the garden that were already watered, also she can't water the ground outside the garden"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Luba has to choose "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"one"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" of the buckets in order to water the garden as fast as possible (as mentioned above, each hour she will water some continuous subsegment of length "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"ai"},{"kind":"text","text":" if she chooses the "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"i"},{"kind":"text","text":"-th bucket). Help her to determine the minimum number of hours she has to spend watering the garden. It is guaranteed that Luba can always choose a bucket so it is possible water the garden."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"See the examples for better understanding."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line of input contains two integer numbers "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":" and "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"k"},{"kind":"text","text":" ("},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1 ≤ n, k ≤ 100"},{"kind":"text","text":") — the number of buckets and the length of the garden, respectively."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The second line of input contains "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":" integer numbers "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"ai"},{"kind":"text","text":" ("},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1 ≤ ai ≤ 100"},{"kind":"text","text":") — the length of the segment that can be watered by the "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"i"},{"kind":"text","text":"-th bucket in one hour."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"It is guaranteed that there is at least one bucket such that it is possible to water the garden in integer number of hours using only this bucket."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Print one integer number — the minimum number of hours required to water the garden."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Examples"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"3 6\n2 3 5\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"2\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"6 7\n1 2 3 4 5 6\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"7\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"note"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the first test the best option is to choose the bucket that allows to water the segment of length "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"3"},{"kind":"text","text":". We can't choose the bucket that allows to water the segment of length "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"5"},{"kind":"text","text":" because then we can't water the whole garden."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the second test we can choose only the bucket that allows us to water the segment of length "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"A","problemCode":"915A","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/915/problem/A"}